<title>JAPAN: Japan May aluminium mill output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan May aluminium mill output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese output and shipments of fabricated aluminium products rose in May from the same period last year, the Japan Aluminum Federation said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The May data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     May 96     yr/yr change  April 96 (revised)</p>
<p> Output	   216,970	+7.6 pct	 226,421 (+7.0 pct)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  114,425	+8.7 pct	 116,826 (+6.2)</p>
<p>   Extrusions   102,545	+6.4 pct	 109,595 (+7.8)</p>
<p> Shipments	220,514	+7.6 pct	 225,387 (+8.2)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  117,540	+8.9 pct	 116,269 (+7.9)</p>
<p>   Extrusions   102,974	+6.1 pct	 109,118 (+8.5)</p>
<p> Inventories     84,545	+4.5 pct	  87,828 (+4.1)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled   70,164	+5.3 pct	  73,091</p>
<p>   Extrusions    14,381	+0.6 pct	  14,737</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
